@customerToken = COLARAQUI
@adminToken = COLARAQUI

### Customer pode consultar

GET http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Customer NÃO pode cadastrar

POST http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
    "title": "Teste",
    "releaseYear": 2000,
    "price": 100,
    "condition": "Novo",
    "rpmSpeed": 33,
    "stockQuantity": 1,
    "artistId": 1,
    "genreId": 1
}

### Admin pode cadastrar

POST http://localhost:3000/api/vinyl-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "title": "Disco Admin Teste",
    "releaseYear": 2000,
    "price": 100,
    "condition": "Novo",
    "rpmSpeed": 33,
    "stockQuantity": 1,
    "artistId": 1,
    "genreId": 1
}

### Teste artists C

POST http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

{
    "name": "Teste Customer",
    "country": "Brasil",
    "bio": "Não deveria ser criado."
}

### Teste artists A

POST http://localhost:3000/api/artists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "name": "Teste Admin",
    "country": "Brasil",
    "bio": "Criado pelo administrador."
}

### Tentar excluir Pink Floyd
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/artists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}